      "content": "GREAT MISSENDEN        AYLESBURY ROAD SP 80 SE 1/4                                                  (east side)                                                      Woodlands Park                                                      (Residential Home for the                                                      Elderly)                                                      II Early to mid C19, large Italianate villa; painted stucco, slate roof.  Two storeys. Garden front has two full height semi-circular bays each side of centre with conical roofs and three sash windows each, the upper ones with glazing bars.  Gabled wing on right, 3 storey tower on left with two round headed openings to top storey and pyramid roof. Listing NGR: SP8888403369"
    }
